msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Cannonball"
msgstr "Cannonball"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid ""
"Cannonball is an enhanced version of the seminal arcade racer OutRun "
"designed by Yu Suzuki in 1986.[CR][CR]Note: OutRun Revision B files are "
"needed. See the file [I]roms needed.txt[/I]."
msgstr "Cannonball är en förbättrad version av den banbrytande arkadracern OutRun som designades av Yu Suzuki 1986.[CR][CR]Notera: OutRun Revision B-filer behövs. Se filen [I]roms needed.txt[/I]."

